# Water Transaction Processing System

This project is a Python-based transaction processing system for a regional water distribution company.

## Features

- Registers water distribution transactions
- Validates transaction IDs, customer references and supply points
- Rejects duplicate transaction IDs
- Rejects negative and zero quantities
- Calculates payment automatically using the approved unit price
- Searches transactions by customer
- Calculates total quantity supplied
- Calculates total revenue collected
- Calculates cumulative quantity and revenue for each customer

## File

`water_transaction_processing.py`

## Unit Price

UGX 10 per litre
